<title>PORTUGAL: Portuguese bonds end firmer, boosted by escudo.</title>
<headline>Portuguese bonds end firmer, boosted by escudo.</headline>
<text>
<p>1710 GMT - Portuguese bonds took heart from a stronger escudo and Bank/Portugal comments on inflation.</p>
<p>*June 97 futures ended up 0.05 points at 106.78.</p>
<p>*Feb 07 cash 98.99 vs 99.98, yield 6.77 pct, off earlier lows.</p>
<p>*Bank/Portugal sees no strong inflation pressure before end 98.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon editorial +(351-1) 3538254</p>
</text>
